      "function": "decode_font",
      "line": null,
      "code": "buf = malloc(size / 4 * 3 + FFMAX(size % 4 - 1, 0));",
      "note": "For the witnessed `size == 32764`, `size % 4 - 1` computes `0 - 1` in `size_t`, wrapping to `SIZE_MAX`; `FFMAX` preserves that value and the final unsigned sum wraps to 24572 instead of the required 24573. The patch changes this expression to `size / 4 * 3 + FFMAX(size % 4, 1) - 1`.",
